stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> PENDING: order.placed → Payment.create + CHARGE PENDING
  PENDING --> PAID: CHARGE SUCCESS, charges ≥ total (payment.succeeded)
  PENDING --> FAILED: CHARGE FAILED / CANCELLED (payment.failed)
  PAID --> PARTIALLY_REFUNDED: refund < total
  PAID --> REFUNDED: refund = total
  PARTIALLY_REFUNDED --> PARTIALLY_REFUNDED: more refunds
  PARTIALLY_REFUNDED --> REFUNDED: refunds = total
  FAILED --> [*]
  REFUNDED --> [*]
